# ==============================================================================
# 1. AI AGENT SCRATCHPADS & LOCAL EXECUTION
# Prevents ephemeral planning, scratch scripts, and agent brainstorming from leaking
# ==============================================================================
.agent/
.agents/scratch/
.agents/runs/
.claude/
.gemini/
.openai/
scratch/
scratch.*
*.scratch.*
tmp/agent/
ai_prompts_local/
*implementation_plan*.md
!docs/plans/                       # Keep official architecture decisions, ignore agent scratch

# ==============================================================================
# 2. AGENTIC IDE WORKSPACES & LOCAL SESSIONS
# IDEs maintain local embeddings, checkpoint diffs, conversation databases, and task state
# ==============================================================================
.cursor/
.cursorrules.local                 # Keep .cursorrules, ignore developer-local overrides
.windsurf/
.codeium/
.aider*
.cline/
.roo/
.continue/
*.db-journal                       # Local vector/session sqlite locks

# ==============================================================================
# 3. HIGH-RISK CREDENTIALS & LEAK PATHS (Targeted by Agent Auto-Scaffolding)
# Agents often suggest writing credentials to local JSON or generating test certs
# ==============================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.env
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
*secret*.key
firebase-debug.log*
firestore-debug.log*

# ==============================================================================
# 4. CONTEXT / TOKEN OPTIMIZATION (Repo Indexing Noise)
# Keeps agent context windows focused; prevents agent search tools from choking on blobs
# ==============================================================================
*.log
*.sqlite
*.dump
coverage/
coverage.out
*.out
*.prof
*.trace
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*

# ==============================================================================
# 5. MONOREPO STANDARD HYGIENE
# ==============================================================================
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.turbo/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db